OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Mighty
OL,6,G     Handful
OL,7,     F2/5. Donald Macleod looks at the
OL,8,     Ftensions within the group of 'The
OL,9,     FFive' composers and their circle,
OL,10,     Fas Rimsky Korsakov and Borodin
OL,11,     Fjoin the fray.
OL,12,G1700 In Tune
OL,13,     FClarinettist Sofia Mekhonoshina
OL,14,     Fand pianist George Herbert play
OL,15,     Flive in studio. Also, William
OL,16,     FDutton talks to Petroc Trelawny
OL,17,     Fabout the creation of the Cuore
OL,18,     FChamber Orchestra.
OL,19,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,20,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,21,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,22,     Ffavourites.
